OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelfast City Council has agreed to
OL,7,Fproceed with building a studio at the
OL,8,FBelfast Stories development, for use by
OL,9,FBBC Northern Ireland and others.
OL,11,FThe news was confirmed in an internal
OL,12,Fcommunication to BBC Northern Ireland
OL,13,Fstaff yesterday.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe full council of 60 members had
OL,7,Fsigned off on the project over the
OL,8,Fsummer, but Sinn Fein sought to have
OL,9,Fthat decision overturned. The party
OL,10,Fargued the council "should not have a
OL,11,Ffinancial relationship with a state
OL,12,Fbroadcaster". It also raised concerns
OL,13,Fabout transparency, fairness, and
OL,14,Fgovernance.
OL,16,FAn independent legal examination of how
OL,17,Fthe decision was reached concluded
OL,18,Fthere was nothing wrong with it,
OL,19,Fleaving the original approval intact
OL,20,Fand clearing the way for officials to
OL,21,Fimplement it.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14303
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the outcome of the legal
OL,7,Freview and subsequent approval by the
OL,8,Fcouncil, Sinn Fein has restated its
OL,9,Funderlying objection ` it does not
OL,10,Faccept that a local authority should be
OL,11,Fin a money-making relationship with
OL,12,FBritain's state broadcaster ` while
OL,13,Fgiving no sign for now of pursuing the
OL,14,Fmatter further.
OL,16,FThe BBC will have access to the new
OL,17,Ffacility for roughly 140 days each
OL,18,Fyear, under an arrangement expected to
OL,19,Frun a decade or longer, and on a shared
OL,20,Frather than exclusive basis.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14304
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe studio will not be BBC-branded and
OL,7,Fwill be free for other bodies to book
OL,8,Ffor screenings, displays and similar
OL,9,Fevents.
OL,11,FFinancially, the Corporation has
OL,12,Fdeclined to discuss what it will pay in
OL,13,Frent or what its productions there will
OL,14,Fcost. Its case for the arrangement
OL,15,Frests on serving both future
OL,16,Fprogramme-making and the broader screen
OL,17,Fsector locally.
OL,19,FA BBC spokesperson told The TV Room:
OL,20,F"We are pleased to be part of the new
OL,21,Fstudio space at Belfast Stories.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14305
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We think that it will facilitate
OL,7,Ffuture BBC productions and support our
OL,8,Flocal screen industries more generally.
OL,9,FPartnership working allows us to do and
OL,10,Fachieve more than would otherwise be
OL,11,Fpossible. And it delivers important
OL,12,Ffinancial benefits as well.
OL,14,F"The Council's decision will allow us
OL,15,Fto progress and finalise the specifics
OL,16,Fof future BBC production activity on
OL,17,Fthe Belfast Stories site and associated
OL,18,Farrangements."
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14306
