OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHAT IS THE BELFAST STORIES PROJECT?
OL,8,FThe scheme behind all this dates back
OL,9,Fto 2021, when the council first went
OL,10,Fpublic with it.
OL,12,FCosted at #100m, the proposed building
OL,13,Fcomplex will occupy a run-down stretch
OL,14,Fof Belfast city centre taking in the
OL,15,Fold Bank of Ireland premises and
OL,16,Fadjoining ground off Royal Avenue,
OL,17,Fbeside Castle Court.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14307
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ambition is for one building doing
OL,7,Fthree jobs simultaneously ` somewhere
OL,8,Fto gather, something to visit, and a
OL,9,Fbase for creative work ` telling
OL,10,FBelfast's history, present and future
OL,11,Fthrough text, imagery and audio, with a
OL,12,Fsizeable event hall at its heart.
OL,14,FMore than 700,000 admissions annually
OL,15,Fis the figure the council is working
OL,16,Ftowards, alongside reviving the
OL,17,Fsurrounding streets and building up the
OL,18,Fcreative economy.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14308
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G8/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,GWHERE DOES BELFAST STORIES SIT IN
OL,7,GRELATION TO RECENT CUTBACKS AT BBC
OL,8,GNORTHERN IRELAND?
OL,10,FThe BBC is attempting to save #500m
OL,11,Fover two years amid rising production
OL,12,Fcosts and a fall in the number of
OL,13,Fpeople paying the licence fee.
OL,15,FWithin that, the Nations are expected
OL,16,Fto deliver #33m, with Northern
OL,17,FIreland's share set at #4.1m by the end
OL,18,Fof 2027/28.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14309
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G9/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn early October BBC Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fconfirmed it had not commissioned new
OL,8,Fseries of long-running shows The Blame
OL,9,FGame and Give My Head Peace ` the panel
OL,10,Fshow clocked up 23 series and the
OL,11,Fsitcom first aired in 1995.
OL,13,FTim McGarry said the team was told by
OL,14,Fe-mail after a 30-year run, which
OL,15,F"stung", and argued that scrapping the
OL,16,Ftwo shows would not save much money.
OL,18,FOther Hole in the Wall Gang output ` A
OL,19,FPerforated Ulster and The Long and the
OL,20,FShort of It ` are also going.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14310
SC,0010
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G10/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC NI had already signalled it would
OL,7,Fclose around 50 full-time-equivalent
OL,8,Fposts alongside other efficiencies, and
OL,9,Fa voluntary redundancy process launched
OL,10,Fin early summer 2026 delivered roughly
OL,11,Fhalf of those.
OL,13,FThe in-house Factual department is to
OL,14,Fclose, with core production capability
OL,15,Fretained for coverage of major events,
OL,16,Fand the Business Operations team will
OL,17,Fbe reshaped to match smaller in-house
OL,18,Fproduction budgets and technical
OL,19,Fsupport needs, with further post
OL,20,Fclosures.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
