CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G11/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC News NI is expected to find more
OL,7,Fsavings through newsroom efficiencies
OL,8,Fand a review of local politics and
OL,9,Ftelevision current affairs output. A
OL,10,Flarger share of Radio Ulster, Foyle and
OL,11,FSounds programming will be sourced from
OL,12,Findependent producers.
OL,14,FThe Irish language unit is going from
OL,15,Ffive full-time staff to two ` four
OL,16,Fposts axed and one new role created `
OL,17,Fwith those affected understood to be
OL,18,Fthree producers and an assistant
OL,19,Fcontent producer.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14312
SC,0012
