OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G12/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC NI maintains that expenditure on
OL,7,FIrish and output totals on Radio
OL,8,FUlster/Foyle will be unchanged, and
OL,9,Fsays the plans are meant to increase
OL,10,FIrish language output while developing
OL,11,Fnew arrangements with independent
OL,12,Fproducers.
OL,14,FIt's also been reported that four
OL,15,FAssistant Content Producer posts at BBC
OL,16,FRadio Foyle are going, to be replaced
OL,17,Fby a single combined post; the four can
OL,18,Fapply for it, but those unsuccessful
OL,19,Fface unemployment and may not receive a
OL,20,Fredundancy payment.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14313
SC,0013
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G13/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest cuts at Radio Foyle leave
OL,7,Fthe station's future looking
OL,8,Fparticularly dubious. The lease on the
OL,9,FNorthland Road building runs until 2029
OL,10,F` a point BBC NI has used when
OL,11,Fanswering questions about the future of
OL,12,Fthe Derry-based station.
OL,14,FMore generally, BBC NI has said work
OL,15,Fhas been under way to assess the impact
OL,16,Fof fewer staff and a smaller budget on
OL,17,Flocal services and to identify how the
OL,18,Fremaining savings can be found, with
OL,19,Ffurther post closures required
OL,20,Falongside structural and operational
OL,21,Fchanges.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14314
SC,0014
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G14/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC NI Director Adam Smyth has said
OL,7,Fadditional work is needed to close the
OL,8,Fremaining gap, with continued union
OL,9,Fconsultation and a review of working
OL,10,Fpractices and output.
OL,12,FSo the #4.1m is not yet fully accounted
OL,13,Ffor, and more announcements should be
OL,14,Fexpected before the 2027/28 deadline.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14315
SC,0015
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G15/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is generally expected among BBC
OL,7,Fstaff that one such announcement will
OL,8,Fbe BBC NI's exit from the Blackstaff
OL,9,Ffacility in Belfast city centre. The
OL,10,Fspeculation has been that if the
OL,11,FBelfast Stories project is green lit,
OL,12,Fthat will be the death knell for
OL,13,FBlackstaff.
OL,15,FBlackstaff is the home of BBC Northern
OL,16,FIreland's largest TV studio ` Studio A
OL,17,F` as well as various technical and
OL,18,Freserve facilities.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14316
SC,0016
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G16/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Corporation's use of Blackstaff
OL,7,Fhas been in decline in recent years,
OL,8,Fwith a gradual reduction in TV
OL,9,Fproduction there for network and local
OL,10,Fprogramming.
OL,12,FStudio A now sits unused for large
OL,13,Fportions of the year, apart from the
OL,14,FNolan show and a handful of network
OL,15,Fproductions.
OL,17,FBBC Broadcasting House in Belfast has
OL,18,Fbeen undergoing refurbishment work over
OL,19,Fthe last few years.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14317
SC,0017
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G17/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FWell over a decade ago there were
OL,7,Fambitious plans to create a new HQ for
OL,8,FBBC Northern Ireland at a new site in
OL,9,FBelfast. Those plans have been long
OL,10,Fsince abandoned in favour of a much
OL,11,Fscaled down alternative.
OL,13,FThe budget for the current "upgrade" of
OL,14,FBroadcasting House was originally
OL,15,Fintended to be #77m. But it's believed
OL,16,Fthat has been more than halved.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14318
SC,0018
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G18/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for various elements ` including
OL,7,Fa large extension to the building,
OL,8,Fshowers and changing facilities, an
OL,9,Fextra floor on the office block, a new
OL,10,Fplant for heating, upgrades to the
OL,11,F1940s metal frame windows ` were
OL,12,Fdropped.
OL,14,FSome staff have been critical of the
OL,15,Fcurrent refurbishment, claiming parts
OL,16,Fof the building have been left
OL,17,Funtouched (many corridors and
OL,18,Fstairwells), and that the work
OL,19,Fcompleted to date is of varying
OL,20,Fquality.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14319
SC,0019
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G19/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn stark contrast to the new HQ
OL,7,Fbuildings created for BBC Scotland and
OL,8,Flatterly, BBC Wales.
OL,10,FWith local in-house TV production
OL,11,Freduced to just News and Current
OL,12,FAffairs, it's unclear what Broadcasting
OL,13,FHouse's updated Studio 1 will be used
OL,14,Ffor. Work on it is yet to be started in
OL,15,Fearnest. It's not been in regular use
OL,16,Ffor years.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14320
SC,0020
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1794406342
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G20/20
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBBC Northern Ireland to get new
OL,4,Cstudio at Belfast Stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier in the year, Sunday Politics
OL,7,Fwas relegated from Studio B (also the
OL,8,Fhome of BBC Newsline). to a newly
OL,9,Fcreated radio/podcast studio, with a
OL,10,Freduced production team. The move to a
OL,11,Fmuch smaller studio also saw the
OL,12,Fprogramme start a simulcast arrangement
OL,13,Fon BBC Radio Ulster.
OL,15,FGiven the trajectory BBC Northern
OL,16,FIreland appears to be on, quite what a
OL,17,Fnew studio at Belfast Stories will
OL,18,Factually be used for is a mystery at
OL,19,Fthis stage.
OL,23,EPub: 06-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
